cuems-power-bridge (0.3.0-5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * cue triggering: add `POST /setnextcue` and `POST /gocue` so
    Companion/Shelly can trigger a specific cue (UUID via `?cue=` or JSON
    body), not just project-level GO/STOP. `/setnextcue` relays
    `/engine/command/setnextcue <uuid>` (select/arm only, no armed gate);
    `/gocue` sends setnextcue then go, gated on `armed` like `/go` and
    allowed mid-show by parity. Both gate on `project_loaded()`
    (409 no_project_loaded); malformed UUID -> 400 invalid_cue; distinct
    rate-limit keys per endpoint. Surfaces `engine.nextcue` in GET /status
    to confirm a selection took effect. Tests:
    tests/test_bridge_gocue.py (17 cases). Refs: ClickUp 869dx367p.

